              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "dǎyìn — \"to print out\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "wǒ xiǎng dǎyìn liǎng zhāng zhàopiàn — I'd like to print two photos."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Its characters come later; for now it is a word for the ear."
            }
          ]
        },
